            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "sense AURAs."},
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "In his Special menu, you will now find"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "a DETECT AURA option."},
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Let's see how this works. First, Talan"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "needs to be in combat..."},
            {"code": 10210, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 184, 184, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11510, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 80, 100, 50], "string": "hydr"},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10001, 8, 0, 0, 14], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [4], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 2, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "Thanks a lot."},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [3], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10001, 8, 0, 0, 13], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [1, 0, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Don't mention it. Anyway, now that"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Talan is in a battle, he can use"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "the DETECT AURA special skill."
            },
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [5], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10001, 8, 0, 0, 24, 25], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11210, "indent": 0, "parameters": [142, 2, 1, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11210, "indent": 0, "parameters": [142, 3, 1, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 2, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "The two Agency Guards are giving"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "off a medium BLUE aura..."
            },
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [1, 0, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "DETECT AURA allows you to see"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "what color aura the enemies have."
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "In this case, a Blue aura."
            },
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "The different color auras have various"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "properties, which you will come to"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "learn as you experiment with the system."
            },
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "In addition to color, DETECT AURA"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "also gives you the aura's strength."
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Stronger auras are more powerful."
            },
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10001, 8, 0, 0, 14], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [4], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 2, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "So what is this good for?"
            },
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [3], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [1, 0, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "I'm getting to that. Once you have"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "detected the enemies' aura, you"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "gain a new skill: ABSORB AURA."
            },
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "By using the ABSORB AURA skill,"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "you can steal techniques which you"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "can then use against the enemies!"
            },
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "The skills you receive are dependant"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "upon the color and strength of the"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "aura."},
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Why don't you try it, Talan?"
            },
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 2, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "Don't mind if I do."},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10001, 8, 0, 0, 13], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [5], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11210, "indent": 0, "parameters": [143, 2, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [3], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11210, "indent": 0, "parameters": [143, 3, 1, 0], "string": ""},
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "TALAN absorbed techniques from"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "the aura of the Agency Guards..."
            },
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [3], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [1, 0, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "So, what did you get?"},
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 2, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10001, 8, 0, 0, 14], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Snazzbanger! I got some healing spells,"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "a spell to raise my attack power, and"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "an attacking spell! This is great!"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "I get to keep these from now on, right?"
            },
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [1, 0, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Um..... no, not exactly. Any skills you"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "absorb go away at the end of the"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "battle."},
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 2, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "What?!"},
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [1, 0, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Sorry about that. Absorbed skills only"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "stay for the duration of the battle."
            },
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "But - if you absorb a certain skill enough"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "times, eventually, you'll have it for good."
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "But the more powerful the skill, the"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "longer it'll take to learn permanently."
            },
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "You can use the Portable Console item"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "to bring up a menu that lets you see how"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "often you have absorbed certain aura"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "abilities, but only when not in combat."
            },
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 2, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "TALAN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "OK, I think I understand how to use"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "auras now. These Agency Guards"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "are going to be feeling some pain!"
            },
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [1, 0, 0, 0], "string": ""},
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Don't get too confident, Talan. It"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "still takes two turns before you have"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "aura skills at your disposal. You need"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "to be cautious."},
            {
              "code": 10110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Good luck! (You'll need it!)"
            },
            {"code": 10120, "indent": 0, "parameters": [0, 0, 1, 0], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10001, 8, 0, 0, 15], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11540, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10830, "indent": 0, "parameters": [127, 128, 129], "string": ""}
